  "Combat.Holli.FuckinJamanjiFlowerDarts.TheDartsFind": " The darts find flesh, and you feel yourself slowing down drastically; all you want to do as the plant woman's poison takes you is fuck and sleep. [say: Just give up,] Holli coos. [saystart]Think how good it would be to fall into my arms and "
  "Combat.Holli.FuckinJamanjiFlowerDarts.ThoughTheDemon": " Though the demon herself is blinded, the fresh eye on the flower seems more than capable of aiming for her!"
  "Combat.Holli.HealHolli.TheBarkSplits": "The bark splits part way and the woman's mouth suddenly explodes with color, her lips folding out into a rather yonic-looking orchid. Copious white-tinted sap oozes from the bloom, coating her bark and healing the lesions. Petals rustle as she speaks wetly through it. [say: Your efforts are nothing! Throw yourself on my mercy; be my slave and do my bidding!]"
  "Combat.Holli.HolliBonusHealing.ASingleRent": "[pg]A single rent forms in the tree's armor-like surface; you can actually see the demon touching her pussy inside, and her eyes roll back as she comes! It looks like teasing her won't be very effective if you can't distract her from pleasuring herself inside her shell."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliBonusHealing.JojoContinuesTo": "[pg]Jojo continues to ferry firewood to stoke the blaze; flames lick at Holli, and her face contorts in anger. Sap flows from her burn wounds, but much of it boils away before it can do her any good and her iron-hard bark is peeling in places."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliBonusHealing.JojoScurriesToward": "[pg]Jojo scurries toward the woodpile carrying a lit torch, but an eye opens on one of the demon's upper branches and she catches him with a root, sending him tumbling. For a moment you lose hope, but the plucky monk rolls to the side before she can deliver another lash and from there to his feet."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliBonusHealing.JojoThrowsAnother": "[pg]Jojo throws another handful of dry leaves and sticks on the growing pile at the demon's roots, then waves and calls to you. [say: [name]! I've got enough dry wood at her base and I'm going to try to set it on fire! Hold on just a bit longer; surcease is coming!]"
  "Combat.Holli.HolliBonusHealing.WaryOfThe": "[pg]Wary of the constant surveillance from above, Jojo serpentines toward the tree at high speed, dodging roots and branches with a burning stick held in his teeth. Just as he gets close enough to throw, a root sweeps low and sends him sprawling onto his own torch, catching some of his {0} alight! Without hesitation, he rolls toward the tinder pile and shoves a burning hand into the leaf litter. As the ring of flammable material catches and the demon screams her frustration, he retreats to the woods, beating his arm with his dirt-smeared robe to put it out."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliBonusHealing.WhatWoundsYou": "[pg]What wounds you have inflicted on the tree-demon overflow with sap, and begin to close! You are left to watch helplessly as she recovers, knotting up her damaged bark until it looks as formidable as before."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliConstrictAttack.AForestOf": "A forest of thick roots bursts from the ground and several lash toward your [legs], trying to ensnare you!"
  "Combat.Holli.HolliConstrictAttack.ItSA": " It's a narrow thing, but you manage to avoid the roots - one of them almost grabs you, but you duck aside and let it find only its neighbor."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliConstrictAttack.LuckilyTheDemon": " Luckily, the demon's blindness makes it fairly easy to dodge the grasping roots, though there are a few close scrapes."
  "Combat.Holli.HolliConstrictAttack.SheLatchesOnto": " She latches onto you with a painful smack and several more root tentacles join the first; as she pulls you close, her bark opens and a long, phallic stalk extends from her crotch, wrapped in thorns and flowering with a rose! It caresses your face, then dangles the blossom above your mouth, dripping her sap. Several of the roots pry your jaws apart, forcing you to drink the tainted fluids from her pseudo-cock! [say: What do you think of my little sap rose?]"
  "Combat.Holli.LightHolliOnFireMagically.TheMagicalFire": "The magical fire effectively ignites a wide swath of Jojo's tinder, and the demon howls in rage. Seeing this, Jojo drops the burning torch he carries and turns back toward the forest to fetch more tinder.[pg]"
