  "Combat.Holli.RunFail.TryToEscape": "try to escape, but {0} wraps one of her writhing roots around your [leg], slamming you to the ground and tying you up with several more! [say: And just where do you think you're going, my little meat?] she hisses. Her bark splits open, exposing her body, and a green shaft snakes out of her crotch, sprouting thorns and blooming into a rose at the tip. She holds the drooling blossom over your [face] as she forces your mouth open with her roots!"
  "Combat.Holli.RunFail.You": "You "
  "Combat.Holli.StruggleOutOfHolli.YouCanT": "You can't move an arm nor a [leg] to bat the flower away... but she's literally holding your mouth open. Your long tongue rolls out, gripping and ripping out several of the petals on the end of her stalk! Holli screams and her roots slacken, allowing you to batter your way out of them."
  "Combat.Holli.StruggleOutOfHolli.YouManageTo": "You manage to force the roots open when the distracted Holli begins to stroke her plant-shaft, pulling out of the bindings just as a drop of sap oozes out and falls where you were standing. You're free!"
  "Combat.Holli.StruggleOutOfHolli.YouTryTo": "You try to escape the entangling roots, but cannot break their grip! "
  "Combat.Holli.Teased.HolliDoesnT": "Holli doesn't even seem to notice, so concerned is she with defeating you before the mounting bonfire causes her any more pain."
  "Combat.Holli.WaitForHolliConstrict.TheOminousRoseate": "The ominous roseate shaft hovers over you, and its owner strokes the base lewdly, moaning. [say: Oooh, gonna... cum!] she shrieks. As a low moan escapes her, the stalk bloats and begins to spill milky-white sap into your mouth! Held rigid, you're eventually forced to swallow just to breathe; the sap slides into your stomach and warmth radiates to your midsection and groin, making you feel flushed and hot. Holli sighs in satisfaction, evidently more relaxed after her climax."
